  → Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  • Rebuild semantics and proofs from clean scratch; run concrete executions
  • Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and every K rule
  • Create and run a fresh false non-vacuity mutation
  • Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
